  "frontier": {
    "note": "M30 B: the lawless frontier (Angren). Each month a neighbouring realm with a ruler takes a free town within reach (map units from one of its own towns) with chance takeChance times its war aggression, if its soldiers number strengthPer times the town's garrison, and holds it with at least holdWith men. Outlaws rise in a frontier town held by anyone else with chance revolt a month, falling to nothing as its garrison nears safeGarrison; the town returns to the frontier with outlaws men. The frontier's wilds are wildLevel points wilder than their ground alone (no law at all) and breed camps and lairs wildness times as often as settled country.",
