    "takeChance": 0.05,
    "strengthPer": 4,
    "holdWith": 60,
    "revolt": 0.06,
    "safeGarrison": 250,
    "outlaws": 25,
    "wildness": 3,
    "wildLevel": 15
  },
  "tierNote": "M29: each realm's tier. Great powers (Temeria, Redania, Kaedwen, Aedirn) court and protect; middle crowns (Cintra) act as rulers do but rarely start trouble with a great power alone; petty kingdoms keep their distance from great kings and seek protection; Mahakam is petty but can only ever be a protectorate; Brokilon sits outside the tiers (none). M30 B: Kovir and Poviss and Lyria and Rivia are middle crowns, the Hengfors League a petty kingdom, and Angren lawless (tier none, no ruler: its towns go to whoever takes them). M30 C: the Nilfgaardian Empire is a great power over four provinces; Toussaint a petty duchy that starts as the Empire's vassal (startsVassalOf). M30 E: Skellige a middle crown at sea, bound to Cintra (boundTo).",
